 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2009-reserva-6-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x+e^{-x}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\), así como los extremos relativos o locales de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Determina los intervalos de concavidad y de convexidad de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Determina las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\). Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=1-e^{-x}=0\\iff e^{-x}=1\\iff\\boxed{x=0}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 192 108' width='100%' style='max-width:230px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H178' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−1) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M125.0 40L161.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 11L161.0 10L159.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,0)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((0,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Mínimo en \\(x=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>: \\(f(0)=1\\).</p><div class='res'>Decrece en \\((-\\infty,0)\\) y crece en \\((0,+\\infty)\\). Mínimo relativo en \\((0,1)\\); no hay máximos</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f''(x)=e^{-x}\\gt0\\ \\text{ para todo }x\\]<div class='res'>\\(f\\) es convexa en todo \\(\\mathbb R\\); no tiene intervalos de concavidad</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Verticales:</b> no hay (\\(f\\) es continua en \\(\\mathbb R\\)).</p><p><b>En </b>\\(+\\infty\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\displaystyle m=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{x+e^{-x}}x=1\\), \\(\\displaystyle n=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}(f(x)-x)=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}e^{-x}=0\\): asíntota oblicua \\(y=x\\).</p><p><b>En </b>\\(-\\infty\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}f(x)=+\\infty\\) y \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{f(x)}x=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(1+\\frac{e^{-x}}x\\right)=-\\infty\\): no hay asíntota horizontal ni oblicua.</p><div class='res'>Única asíntota: la oblicua \\(y=x\\) (cuando \\(x\\to+\\infty\\))</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado d",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Mínimo en \\((0,1)\\), convexa, se acerca a \\(y=x\\) por encima a la derecha (\\(e^{-x}\\gt0\\)) y sube muy deprisa a la izquierda.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='60.0,76.0 62.8,83.9 65.5,91.2 68.2,97.8 71.0,103.8 73.8,109.2 76.5,114.2 79.2,118.6 82.0,122.6 84.8,126.2 87.5,129.3 90.3,132.2 93.0,134.6 95.8,136.7 98.5,138.6 101.2,140.1 104.0,141.4 106.8,142.5 109.5,143.3 112.2,143.9 115.0,144.3 117.8,144.6 120.5,144.6 123.2,144.5 126.0,144.2 128.8,143.8 131.5,143.3 134.2,142.7 137.0,141.9 139.8,141.0 142.5,140.0 145.2,139.0 148.0,137.8 150.8,136.6 153.5,135.3 156.2,133.9 159.0,132.4 161.8,130.9 164.5,129.3 167.2,127.7 170.0,126.0 172.8,124.3 175.5,122.6 178.2,120.8 181.0,118.9 183.8,117.0 186.5,115.1 189.2,113.2 192.0,111.2 194.8,109.2 197.5,107.2 200.2,105.1 203.0,103.1 205.8,101.0 208.5,98.9 211.2,96.7 214.0,94.6 216.8,92.4 219.5,90.2 222.2,88.1 225.0,85.9 227.7,83.6 230.5,81.4 233.2,79.2 236.0,76.9 238.8,74.7 241.5,72.4 244.2,70.2 247.0,67.9 249.8,65.6 252.5,63.3 255.2,61.0 258.0,58.7 260.8,56.4 263.5,54.1 266.2,51.8 269.0,49.5 271.8,47.1 274.5,44.8 277.2,42.5 280.0,40.1' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='100.0,196.5 190.0,118.7 280.0,40.8' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='120.0' cy='144.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='126.0' y='156.6'>(0,1)</text><text x='252.0' y='89.2' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y=x</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 179.2H294.0M120.0 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='40.0' y1='176.2' x2='40.0' y2='182.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='37.0' y='193.2' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='80.0' y1='176.2' x2='80.0' y2='182.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='77.0' y='193.2' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='160.0' y1='176.2' x2='160.0' y2='182.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='157.0' y='193.2' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='200.0' y1='176.2' x2='200.0' y2='182.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='197.0' y='193.2' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='240.0' y1='176.2' x2='240.0' y2='182.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='237.0' y='193.2' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='117.0' y1='144.6' x2='123.0' y2='144.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='104.0' y='148.6' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='117.0' y1='110.0' x2='123.0' y2='110.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='104.0' y='114.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='117.0' y1='75.4' x2='123.0' y2='75.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='104.0' y='79.4' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='117.0' y1='40.8' x2='123.0' y2='40.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='104.0' y='44.8' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div></div>"
