  {
   "id": "matematicas-2009-reserva-6-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas por \\(f(x)=x^2+|x|\\), \\(g(x)=2\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Determina los puntos de corte de las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\). Esboza dichas gráficas.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por dichas gráficas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2-x&\\text{si }x\\lt0\\\\x^2+x&\\text{si }x\\geq0\\end{cases}\\]<p>\\(f\\) es par (\\(f(-x)=f(x)\\)): su gráfica es simétrica respecto del eje \\(OY\\). Para \\(x\\geq0\\): \\(x^2+x=2\\iff x^2+x-2=0\\iff x=1\\) (la otra raíz, \\(-2\\), no vale). Por simetría, también \\(x=-1\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='85.0,77.4 88.2,77.4 91.5,77.4 94.8,77.4 98.0,77.4 101.2,77.4 104.5,77.4 107.8,77.4 111.0,77.4 114.2,77.4 117.5,77.4 120.8,77.4 124.0,77.4 127.2,77.4 130.5,77.4 133.8,77.4 137.0,77.4 140.2,77.4 143.5,77.4 146.8,77.4 150.0,77.4 153.2,77.4 156.5,77.4 159.8,77.4 163.0,77.4 166.2,77.4 169.5,77.4 172.8,77.4 176.0,77.4 179.2,77.4 182.5,77.4 185.8,77.4 189.0,77.4 192.2,77.4 195.5,77.4 198.8,77.4 202.0,77.4 205.2,77.4 208.5,77.4 211.8,77.4 215.0,77.4 215.0,77.4 211.8,83.5 208.5,89.3 205.2,95.0 202.0,100.4 198.8,105.6 195.5,110.7 192.2,115.5 189.0,120.1 185.8,124.5 182.5,128.7 179.2,132.7 176.0,136.5 172.8,140.1 169.5,143.5 166.2,146.7 163.0,149.6 159.8,152.4 156.5,155.0 153.2,157.3 150.0,159.5 146.8,157.3 143.5,155.0 140.2,152.4 137.0,149.6 133.8,146.7 130.5,143.5 127.2,140.1 124.0,136.5 120.8,132.7 117.5,128.7 114.2,124.5 111.0,120.1 107.8,115.5 104.5,110.7 101.2,105.6 98.0,100.4 94.8,95.0 91.5,89.3 88.2,83.5 85.0,77.4' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='46.0,-11.2 47.7,-6.6 49.5,-2.1 51.2,2.3 52.9,6.7 54.7,11.1 56.4,15.3 58.1,19.6 59.9,23.7 61.6,27.8 63.3,31.9 65.1,35.8 66.8,39.8 68.5,43.6 70.3,47.4 72.0,51.2 73.7,54.9 75.5,58.5 77.2,62.1 78.9,65.6 80.7,69.0 82.4,72.4 84.1,75.8 85.9,79.1 87.6,82.3 89.3,85.5 91.1,88.6 92.8,91.6 94.5,94.6 96.3,97.5 98.0,100.4 99.7,103.2 101.5,106.0 103.2,108.7 104.9,111.3 106.7,113.9 108.4,116.4 110.1,118.9 111.9,121.3 113.6,123.6 115.3,125.9 117.1,128.2 118.8,130.3 120.5,132.5 122.3,134.5 124.0,136.5 125.7,138.5 127.5,140.3 129.2,142.2 130.9,143.9 132.7,145.6 134.4,147.3 136.1,148.9 137.9,150.4 139.6,151.9 141.3,153.3 143.1,154.6 144.8,155.9 146.5,157.2 148.3,158.4 150.0,159.5 151.7,158.4 153.5,157.2 155.2,155.9 156.9,154.6 158.7,153.3 160.4,151.9 162.1,150.4 163.9,148.9 165.6,147.3 167.3,145.6 169.1,143.9 170.8,142.2 172.5,140.3 174.3,138.5 176.0,136.5 177.7,134.5 179.5,132.5 181.2,130.3 182.9,128.2 184.7,125.9 186.4,123.6 188.1,121.3 189.9,118.9 191.6,116.4 193.3,113.9 195.1,111.3 196.8,108.7 198.5,106.0 200.3,103.2 202.0,100.4 203.7,97.5 205.5,94.6 207.2,91.6 208.9,88.6 210.7,85.5 212.4,82.3 214.1,79.1 215.9,75.8 217.6,72.4 219.3,69.0 221.1,65.6 222.8,62.1 224.5,58.5 226.3,54.9 228.0,51.2 229.7,47.4 231.5,43.6 233.2,39.8 234.9,35.8 236.7,31.9 238.4,27.8 240.1,23.7 241.9,19.6 243.6,15.3 245.3,11.1 247.1,6.7 248.8,2.3 250.5,-2.1 252.3,-6.6 254.0,-11.2' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,77.4 150.0,77.4 280.0,77.4' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='85.0' cy='77.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='39.0' y='71.4'>(−1,2)</text><circle cx='215.0' cy='77.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='221.0' y='71.4'>(1,2)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 159.5H294.0M150.0 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='85.0' y1='156.5' x2='85.0' y2='162.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='82.0' y='173.5' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='215.0' y1='156.5' x2='215.0' y2='162.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='212.0' y='173.5' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='118.5' x2='153.0' y2='118.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='122.5' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='77.4' x2='153.0' y2='77.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='81.4' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='36.4' x2='153.0' y2='36.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='40.4' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((-1,2)\\) y \\((1,2)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(-1\\) y \\(1\\) la recta \\(y=2\\) queda por encima. Por la simetría, calculo la mitad derecha y multiplico por 2:</p>\\[A=2\\int_0^1\\bigl(2-x^2-x\\bigr)dx=2\\Bigl[2x-\\frac{x^3}3-\\frac{x^2}2\\Bigr]_0^1=2\\left(2-\\frac13-\\frac12\\right)=\\frac73\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac73\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
