<circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec u,\\vec v]=\\begin{vmatrix}1&-2&-1\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(2+0-1\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+1-4\\bigr)\\]\\[=4\\neq0\\]<div class='res'>Las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cruzan</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene la dirección \\(\\vec v\\) (contiene a \\(s\\)) y la \\(\\vec u\\) (paralelo a \\(r\\)):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec u\\times\\vec v=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&1&1\\\\0&1&2\\end{vmatrix}=(1,\\,-2,\\,1)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(x-2y+z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(S(1,0,2)\\): \\(1+2+D=0\\iff D=-3\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-63,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"line\",[1.0,-1.2,-0.4],[1.0,1.2,4.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.0,1.2,4.4],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1.2,0.8,1.8],[1.4,3.4,4.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.4,3.4,4.4],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[2.014,1.644,4.274],[-0.923,0.175,4.274],[-0.014,-1.644,-0.274],[2.923,-0.175,-0.274]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-0.014,-1.644,-0.274],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"pt\",[1,0,2],\"S\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,2,3],\"R\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m09r6a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m09r6a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m09r6a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m09r6a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='68.6' y1='246.0' x2='110.5' y2='43.7' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='116.5' y='43.7' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='28.0' y1='127.3' x2='162.7' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='168.7' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><polygon points='153.1,49.1 26.6,48.8 26.0,240.6 152.5,240.9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='240.6' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><circle cx='89.5' cy='144.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='96.5' y='138.8' font-weight='700'>S</text><circle cx='90.2' cy='76.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='97.2' y='70.8' font-weight='700'>R</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='38.3' y2='272.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='40.2' y='277.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='31.3' y2='264.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.8' y='266.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(x-2y+z-3=0\\)</div></div>"
